   polls again for a Disarm before it applies the message received first,
   which is then no longer the latest:

     Typing error: Variable `latest` is unboxed with grade `[{Receive; (0 |
       Disarm)}, {Receive; (0 | Disarm)}]` accumulated since it was bound,
       which is not below its box grade `[{(!_ & ~Receive)*}, {(!_ &
